+  /* Extra built-in alignment methods, slots 3 to 10.
+     Like slots 1 and 2 above, they are rewritten every time this runs,
+     so methods added by hand in the GUI should go into slots 11 to 15.
+     Each name is the program Seaview runs; it must be in PATH.
+     %f is replaced by a temporary file name: Seaview writes the sequences
